WEBVTT

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:31.130
So they let him go.

00:15:31.154 --> 00:15:33.175
And outside in the corridor he said to me,

00:15:33.199 --> 00:15:34.354
"You know what, Jon?

00:15:34.841 --> 00:15:36.804
Everyone's a bit psychopathic."

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.887
He said, "You are, I am.
Well, obviously I am."

00:15:42.016 --> 00:15:44.028
I said, "What are you going to do now?"

00:15:44.052 --> 00:15:46.235
He said, "I'm going to go to Belgium.

00:15:46.259 --> 00:15:47.937
There's a woman there that I fancy.

00:15:47.961 --> 00:15:51.916
But she's married, so I'm going to have
to get her split up from her husband."

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:55.697
(Laughter)

00:15:56.075 --> 00:15:59.108
Anyway, that was two years ago,

00:15:59.132 --> 00:16:00.710
and that's where my book ended.